","description":"H2D与相关附加功能模块的技术参数"},"h2s":{"title":"拓竹 H2S | 多合一 3D 打印机。","description":"拓竹 H2S，终极单头 3D 打印机，融合激光切割、激光雕刻、数字刀切、绘图功能。高精度、快速、多合一。"},"series":{"h2":{"title":"拓竹 H2 系列：四合一 3D 打印机，集 3D 打印、激光雕刻、数字刀切和绘图为一体","desc":"拓竹 H2 系列结合了 FDM 3D 打印、激光雕刻、数字刀切和绘图 —— 从超凡想法到精致细节的落地，它是承载你无限创造力的一体化个人智造中心。"}},"privacy":{"title":"隐私政策"},"aoneRecall":{"title":"拓竹A1打印机召回登记"}},"link":{"X1Series_Maintenance":"https://space.bilibili.com/494293576/lists/1347748?type=season","A1_mini_Series":"https://space.bilibili.com/494293576/lists/1736129?type=season","General_Machine_Maintenance":"https://space.bilibili.com/494293576/lists/600897?type=season","Installation_Guide_and_Usage":"https://space.bilibili.com/494293576/lists/602438?type=season","Troubleshooting":"https://space.bilibili.com/494293576/lists/600900?type=season","3D_Printing_Tips":"https://space.bilibili.com/494293576/lists/3276437?type=season","Creative_Model_Building":"https://space.bilibili.com/494293576/lists/2005449?type=season","findSN":"https://wiki.bambulab.com/zh/general/find-sn","findOrderNoLink":"https://wiki.bambulab.com/zh/general/check-order-number","bindDevicesLink":"https://wiki.bambulab.com/zh/knowledge-sharing/printer-account-binding-guide","howToHub":{"P2S_Series":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546957733694374/lists/4989137?type=series","H2C_Series":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546957733694374/lists/5027925?type=series","H2S_Series":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546957733694374/lists/4933039?type=series","H2D_Series":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546957733694374/lists/4899163?type=series","A1_Series":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546957733694374/lists/4899175?type=series","Filament_Parts":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546957733694374/lists/5075139?type=series","Creative_Workshop":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546957733694374/lists/5071897?type=series","X1_Series":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546957733694374/lists/4899173?type=series","P1_Series":"https://space.bilibili.com/3546957733694374/lists/4899174?type=serie