es not match","pleaseSetPassword":"Please set a login password"},"verification_code":"Verification code","appleDialogTitle":"Notice","appleDialogText":"We would like to remind you that if you use Apple's “Hide My Email” service, you may not receive emails due to email server restrictions.","CancellationCheckText":"I agree to \u003c1\u003eTerms of Account Cancellation\u003c/1\u003e","cancel_confirm":"Delete Account","cancel_confirm_content":"We're sorry to see you go. Once your account is deleted, all of your personal data will be permanently gone and cannot be reinstated.","cancel_confirm_desc":{"1":"All your data on MakerWorld","2":"All your data on Bambu Lab website","3":"All your data on Bambu Lab Store","desc":"We're sorry to see you go. Once your account is deleted, the associated email address cannot be used to register a new account within 30 days. Additionally, all of your personal data will be permanently deleted and cannot be reinstated, including","deleteDialogDesc":"Once your account is deleted, the associated email address cannot be used to register a new account within 30 days.","reminderTitle":"Please note:","reminder":"\u003c0\u003eFor more details, please refer to  \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eAccount Deletion Reminder\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e\u003c/2\u003e"},"cancel_successful":"Delete successful","cancel_feedback":"The account will be deleted within 30 minutes, and you can still use it normally during this period.","account_unequal_title":"Inconsistent accounts","account_unequal_content":"It is detected that the account to be deleted is inconsistent with the current login account. Please log out of the current account first, log in with the account to be deleted, and then continue with the deletion operation.","account_unequal_text":"\u003c0\u003eYou are currently logged in with another account on \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e{{host}}\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e. Please click the logout button below to proceed.\u003c/2\u003e","logout":"Log Out","accountTitle":"Bambu Lab \u0026 MakerWorld Account","verificationCodeDialog":{"title":"Verification Code","content":"To keep your account secure, please enter the verification code sent to {{account}}"},"mwStore":{"mw_creator_alliance":"MakerMarket Alliance","title":"\u003ckeywords\u003eWelcome to\u003c/keywords\u003e\nMakerMarket Alliance","trackOrder":"Track Order","desc":{"1":"{{sellerName}} powered by MakerMarket.","2":"Sign up/login to your free MakerMarket Alliance account for all designer stores.","3":"Track orders, manage support, get exclusive perks.","4":"Your data \u0026 orders protected per GDPR."},"iconDesc":{"1":"Secure privacy","2":"Honest Delivery","3":"Made-to-Order","4":"Premium Quality"}},"delete":{"firstPage":{"title":"Delete Account","desc":"We're sorry to see you go. Before proceeding, we want to assure that you are aware of the following consequences:","notice":"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eOnce your account is deleted, the associated email address cannot be used to register a new account within 30 days. \u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAll of your personal data will be permanently deleted and cannot be reinstated, including:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAll your data on MakerWorld\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAll your data on Bambu Lab website\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAll your data on Bambu Lab Store\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","reminder":"For more details, please refer to \u003creminderLink\u003eAccount Deletion Reminder\u003c/reminderLink\u003e","nextStepDesc":"If you have made your decision, we will need to verify your identity before proceed to the final step.","continueText":"Continue to Verify"},"verify":{"verify":"Verify","otherLabel":"Other ways of verification","change":"Change verification method","resend":"Resend","otherButton":{"email":"Verify via Email","twoFactor":"Verify via Two-Factor Authentication","phone":"Verify via Phone"},"password":{"title":"Identity Verification","desc":"To protect the security of your account, Bambu wants to verify your identity before proceed.","label":"Please enter your password"},"email":{"title":"Verify via Email","desc":"An email with a verification code was just sent to your email: \u003caccount\u003e{{account}}\u003c/account\u003e","enterCode":"Enter Code"},"phone":{"title":"Verify via Phone","desc":"A message with a verification code was just sent to your phone number: \u003caccount\u003e{{account}}\u003c/account\u003e","enterCode":"Enter Code"},"twoFactor":{"title":"Verify via 2-Factor Authentication","desc":"Please enter the \u003cb\u003e6-digit verification code\u003c/b\u003e from the identity authentication app (Such as Google Authenticator, Duo Mobile)."}},"finalPage":{"title":"Delete Account -  Final Confirmation","desc":"By proceeding, please confirm:","notice":"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou understand \u003cred\u003ethis cannot be undone.\u003c/red\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou understand the associated email cannot be used to register a new account within 30 days.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou will \u003cred\u003elose the following information Permanently:\u003c/red\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAll your data on MakerWorld\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAll your data on Bambu Lab website\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAll your data on Bambu Lab Store\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou have reviewed our \u003creminderLink\u003eAccount Deletion Reminder\u003c/reminderLink\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","agree":"I agree to \u003cterm\u003eTerms of Account Cancellation\u003c/term\u003e","deleteButton":"Delete My Account"},"final":{"title":"Delete your Bambu Lab \u0026 MakerWorld Account","desc":"Please read this carefully:","notice":"You're trying to delete your Bambu Lab \u0026 MakerWorld Account, which provides access to various \u003cproductOrServicesLink\u003eBambu Lab Products or Services\u003c/productOrServicesLink\u003e. Once deleted, you'll no longer be able to use any of those products or services, and your account and data will be permanently deleted. Please note that you will be unable to re-register a new account using the same email address for 30 days following the deletion.","agree1":"I have read the article \u003cafterDeleteLink\u003eWhat happens after you delete your Bambu Lab \u0026 MakerWorld account\u003c/afterDeleteLink\u003e.","agree2":"I want to permanently delete the Bambu Lab \u0026 MakerWorld account and all its data.","deleteButton":"Delete My Account"}}},"area":{"name":{"AT":"Austria","BE":"Belgium","BG":"Bulgaria","HR":"Croatia","CY":"Cyprus","CZ":"Czech Republic","DE":"Germany","DK":"Denmark","EE":"Estonia","FI":"Finland","FR":"France","GR":"Greece","HU":"Hungary","IE":"Ireland","IT":"Italy","LV":"Latvia","LT":"Lithuania","LU":"Luxembourg","MT":"Malta","NL":"Netherlands","PL":"Poland","PT":"Portugal","RO":"Romania","SK":"Slovakia","SI":"Slovenia","ES":"Spain","SE":"Sweden","US":"United States","CA":"Canada"}},"store":{"usa":"United States","eu":"Europe","ca":"Canada","uk":"United Kingdom","au":"Australia","jp":"Japan","kr":"Korea","asia":"Asia"},"common":{"complete":"Complete","mins":"mins","showMore":"Show More","showLess":"Show Less","reason":"Reason","more":"More","upload":"Upload","cancel":"Cancel","confirm":"Confirm","continue":"Continue","notice":"Notice","delete":"Delete","important":"Important","edit":"Edit","loading":"Loading","noOptions":"No options","other":"Other","on":"ON","off":"OFF","publish":"Publish","save":"Save","submit":"Submit","success":"Success","copySuccess":"Copied to the clipboard!","copyFileLinkSuccess":"Copied, please visit the link via the browser.","copyerror":"Copy failed!","fileMaxSize":"File size must be less than {{size}}.","tooManyFiles":"Maximum Number of Files Allowed: {{count}}","fileInvalidType":"File type invalid","invalidFileName":"Invalid file name","uploadError":"Upload error","unknownError":"Unknown error","endsInDate":"Ends in {{date}}","maintain":{"title":"Website Under Maintenance","desc":"Our website is currently undergoing scheduled maintenance.\nWe should be back in {{time}} hour. Thank you for your patience."},"submitSuccess":"Submission successful","feedback":"Feedback","languages":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","fr":"French","es":"Spanish","de":"German","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","nl":"Dutch","vi":"Vietnamese","ru":"Russian","hu":"Hungarian","pl":"Polish","tr":"Turkish","hi":"Hindi","ar":"Arabic"},"add":"Add","remove":"Remove","learnMore":"Learn more","buyNow":"Buy now","watchVideo":"Watch video","subscribe":"Subscribe","comingSoon":"Coming soon...","return":"Return","subscribeDialog":{"title":"Subscribe","desc":"Subscribe to get the latest update.","placeholder":"Please enter your Email","button":"Subscribe","privacyPolicy":"\u003c0\u003eI consent to the \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eTerms of use\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e and \u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003ePrivacy Notice\u003c/3\u003e\u003c4\u003e.\u003c/4\u003e","validEmail":"Please enter a valid email","needAgreePrivacyPolicy":"You need agree to Privacy Notice","success":"Thanks for Subscribing"},"leaveDialog":{"title":"You have unsaved changes","content":"Do you want to save your changes before exiting the project editor?","cancel":"Cancel","notSave":"Don't Save","saveDraft":"Save Draft","save":"Save"},"error":{"networkError":"Network Error","tooManyRequests":"You have sent too many requests in a given amount of time. Please try again later."},"quarterSelect":{"yearLabel":"Year:","quarterLabel":"Quarter:","quarterValues":{"1":"First Quarter","2":"Second Quarter","3":"Third Quarter","4":"Fourth Quarter"}},"subHeader":{"overview":"Overview","diveIn":"Dive In","specs":"Specs","faq":"FAQ","buy":"Buy","contactUs":"Contact Us"}},"product":{"fleetHub":{"common":{"subHeaderName":"Fleet Hub","name":"Bambu Lab Fleet Hub","contactUs":"Contact Us","findReseller":"Find Reseller","slogan":"Offline Fleet Command. Seamless Enterprise Workflow.","developerLink":"Get Started\u003e"},"form":{"desc":"Please describe your intended use case, estimated printer fleet size, and integration requirements to help us better assist you."},"sections":{"1":{"sectionTitle":"Local Network Fleet Control","title":"Manage Printers with Zero External Reliance","desc":"Orchestrate your entire fleet in a fully decentralized environment. By keeping control dashboards, telemetry, and high-fidelity liveview streams strictly on-premise, you ensure maximum operational privacy and stability."},"2":{"sectionTitle":"Seamless MES \u0026 ERP Integration","title":"Standardized API for Industrial Automation","desc":"Bridge the gap between 3D printing and smart manufacturing using our Standardized API with copy-paste-ready code examples. Fleet Hub supports native, low-latency embedding into existing MES, ERP, or PLM systems for end-to-end production traceability and automated workflows."},"3":{"sectionTitle":"Hardware-Based Defense in Depth","title":"Silicon-Rooted Protection for Proactive System Defense","desc":"Fleet Hub implements a comprehensive security architecture built on a Hardware Root of Trust (RoT). By integrating Secure Boot, Verified Boot, and a Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), the system ensures only cryptographically signed firmware can execute. A hardware-isolated security engine protects encryption keys from software-based attacks, while Mandatory Access Control (MAC) provides strict architectural isolation. This multi-layered strategy prevents lateral movement within your network, ensuring that a single-point vulnerability cannot compromise the broader system."},"4":{"sectionTitle":"Private \u0026 Encrypted Networking","title":"Passes Every IT Security Audit.","desc":"Fleet Hub is designed to meet enterprise security requirements — no exceptions, no workarounds, no policy modifications. Every audit checkpoint answered before the auditor asks."},"5":{"sectionTitle":"Secure Identity \u0026 Access Management","title":"Private keys stay with you. Access stays protected.","desc":"Fleet Hub combines customer-controlled key ownership, activation-bound certificate verification, and session-based authorization to provide trusted access for authenticated clients."},"6":{"sectionTitle":"Total Data Sovereignty","title":"Secure Lifecycle Management for Proprietary Designs.","desc":"Bambu Fleet Hub operates entirely offline post-activation, ensuring zero outbound data transmission. 3D models and camera snapshots are transmitted via mTLS-encrypted HTTPS and stored within a dedicated 40GB local-only cache. This architecture safeguards your intellectual property against both digital interception and physical intrusion."},"7":{"sectionTitle":"Dedicated Engineering Support","title":"Expert-Led Implementation and Maintenance","desc":"Accelerate your deployment with direct access to our Solution Engineering Team. From initial API integration and security auditing to ongoing technical maintenance, we provide the specialized support required to ensure maximum uptime for your mission-critical operations."}},"note":{"1":"The information above provides a general overview of Fleet Hub's features and capabilities. For detailed technical specifications, security architecture, and compliance documentation, please refer to the \u003cTechnicalLink\u003eFleet Hub Technical White Paper\u003c/TechnicalLink\u003e and \u003cSecurityLink\u003eSecurity White Paper\u003c/SecurityLink\u003e. For API Documentation, visit the \u003cStartedLink\u003eGet Started\u003c/StartedLink\u003e page to apply for developer access. For further inquiries, contact us at \u003cemail\u003edevpartner@bambulab.com\u003c/email\u003e","title":"Note"}}},"developer":{"fleetHub":{"public":{"banner":{"title":"Developer Authorization ","desc":"Developer authorization enables Fleet Hub technical access capabilities. Once enabled, you can create device activation keys, issue client certificates used to establish secure communication with the Fleet Hub API, and access API documentation and sample code for interface validation and integration development. You can complete the process online after reviewing and agreeing to the relevant terms.\nFor business cooperation inquiries, please contact us through the Technical \u0026 Business Support channel.","button":"Apply for Authorization","enterConsole":"Enter Console","agreement":"I have read and agree to the \u003cagreementLink\u003eDeveloper Agreement\u003c/agreementLink\u003e and \u003cprivacyLink\u003ePrivacy Statement\u003c/privacyLink\u003e","checkAgreement":"Please agree to the Developer Agreement and Privacy Statement","success":"Developer authorization successful","error":"Developer authorization failed"},"usageProcess":{"1":{"step":"Step 1","title":"Evaluate Integration Options","desc":"Review the relevant technical documentation to evaluate integration feasibility."},"2":{"step":"Step 2","title":"Prepare the Development Environment","desc":"Plan device procurement based on your project schedule, or complete authorization first and purchase devices later."},"3":{"step":"Step 3","title":"Activate Developer Access","desc":"After reviewing and agreeing to the Developer Agreement online, you can complete developer authorization through self-service."},"4":{"step":"Step 4","title":"Configure Security Credentials","desc":"Follow the quick start guide to configure your key and certificates."},"5":{"step":"Step 5","title":"Start Building","desc":"Use the API documentation and sample code to quickly begin API integration and system development."},"title":"Getting Started"},"documentation":{"1":{"name":"Security White Paper\u003e"},"2":{"name":"Technical White Paper\u003e"},"3":{"name":"Firmware Versions and Release Notes\u003e"},"title":"Documentation and Support"},"support":{"title":"Technical \u0026 Business Support","desc":"If you need consultation on Fleet Hub technical solutions, development support, or business cooperation, feel free to contact us at: \u003cmailto\u003edevpartner@bambulab.com\u003c/mailto\u003e"}},"private":{"backText":"Get Started","activationKey":{"title":"Activation Key","desc":"A credential used to access cloud services during Fleet Hub activation. During device activation, the system uses this key to submit the device identification and certificate information required for activation, obtain the necessary activation data, and complete the activation process. This key is not used for Fleet Hub local API communication.","create":"Generate Activation Key","reset":"Reset Activation Key","dialog":{"create":{"title":"Activation Key","desc":"Please keep your activation key in a secure place.\nThis key will only be shown once after generation and cannot be viewed again after the window is closed.\nIf it is lost, you can only generate a new one by resetting the key.","copy":"Copy Activation Key"},"reset":{"title":"Confirm Reset Activation Key","desc":"After the reset, the current activation key will become invalid immediately and can no longer be used to activate new Fleet Hub devices.\nThis action cannot be undone, and the system will generate a new activation key.\nDo you want to continue?"}}},"clientCertificate":{"create":{"title":"Client Certificate Issuance","desc":"After you upload a client public key, the system will issue a client certificate for that key to establish secure communication between the client and the Fleet Hub API. Fleet Hub uses mutual TLS (mTLS) for identity authentication, and the endpoint certificates used in communication are X.509 certificates issued by Bambu Lab.","note":"Please paste the public key in text format. Up to 5 client certificates can be issued and stored at a time. RSA 4096 signing algorithm is recommended.","button":"Issue","placeholder":"Paste your public key here (-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----) \n\nTo generate a key pair locally, run:\n  openssl genrsa -out private.key 4096\n  openssl rsa -in private.key -pubout\n\nThen copy the public key output and paste it here."},"management":{"column":{"date":"Issued Date","expiry":"Expiry Date","action":"Action"},"certificateName":"Certificate {{serialNumber}}","download":"Download","delete":"Delete","deleteDialog":{"title":"Delete Client Certificate","desc":"After deletion, the certificate can no longer be used for new device activation or new client deployments; however, clients that have already installed the certificate can continue communicating with Fleet Hub."},"title":"Client Certificate"}},"documentation":{"1":{"name":"API Reference Documentation\u003e"},"2":{"name":"Demo Code Download\u003e"},"title":"Documentation and Support"},"revokeAuthorization":{"revokeText":"Revoke Developer Authorization","desc":"If you no longer need Fleet Hub developer access, you may revoke your developer authorization.","dialog":{"title":"Confirm Revoke Developer Authorization","desc":"After revocation, the activation keys and issued client certificates created on this page will be automatically invalidated and can no longer be used to activate new devices. Devices that have already been deployed and configured with previously issued client certificates can continue to operate without interruption. If you no longer need these capabilities, we recommend restoring the devices to factory settings.\nIn addition, you will not be able to apply for developer authorization again within \u003cb\u003e30 days\u003c/b\u003e from the date of revocation."}}}}},"header":{"collections":"Collection borad","creation":"Creation","likes":"Likes","login":"Log In","logout":"Log Out","print_history":"Print history","sign_in":"Log In","sign_in_or_sign_up":"Log In / Sign Up","sign_up":"Sign Up","store":"Store","shopNow":"Shop now","support-tickets":"Support Ticket","profile-setting":"Profile Setting","betaFirmwareProgram":"Beta Firmware Program","toBuy":"To Buy"},"schema":{"schemaName":{"defaultSchemaName":"Application","bambuForest":"Bambu Farm Manager","bambuConnect":"Bambu Connect"},"schemaCallback":{"success":{"title":"Login Successful","desc":"\u003c0\u003eRedirecting to {{schemaName}}... You may also \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eclick to enter\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e\u003c/2\u003e"}}},"studio":{"studioCallback":{"error":{"title":"Login Failed","desc":"Login failed, please go back to \u003c1\u003eBambu Studio\u003c/1\u003e and log in again.","suiteDesc":"Login failed, please go back to \u003c1\u003eBambu Suite\u003c/1\u003e and log in again."},"success":{"title":"Login Successful","desc":"The login is successful, please enter \u003c1\u003eBambu Studio\u003c/1\u003e to check the login status information.","suiteDesc":"The login is successful, please enter \u003c1\u003eBambu Suite\u003c/1\u003e to check the login status information."}}},"trouble":{"technicalUploadPrivacy":"Please do not upload sensitive personal data, or any files unrelated to your technical issues, in the attachment.","technicalPrivacyPolicy":{"desc1":"By clicking Submit, you acknowledge that Bambu Lab will process the information you submit in this form, including the device and application logs submitted with your request, together with ticket logs and your account ID, for the following purposes:","desc2":"To provide after-sales service, troubleshooting and diagnostics;","desc3":"To improve our products and services, including improving our AI services and features. The device and application logs may include system operation and device control records, video and image data generated by printer cameras, and network and application event information;","desc4":"You may opt out of processing for improving our products and services at any time by contacting us using the details provided in our Privacy Notice. For full details of how we process your personal data, please see our \u003c1\u003ePrivacy Notice\u003c/1\u003e."},"generalUploadPrivacy":"Please do not upload any personal data unrelated to the consultation in the attachments, and please be careful not to upload sensitive personal data.","generalPrivacyPolicy":"By clicking the checkbox, you agree that Bambu Lab may process the personal data you submit in this form in accordance with its \u003c1\u003ePrivacy Notice\u003c/1\u003e, for the purposes of resolving your after-sales issue, verifying your identity, providing product after-sales support, and improving the after-sales service experience.","allTickets":"All Tickets","Attachments":"Attachments","addDesc":"Reply to Ticket","problemSolved":"The problem has been solved","addFilament":"Add Filaments","addMaterial":"Add Materials","addFromSD":"New Ticket ","addSDLogOrVideo":"Upload attachment","afterSalesRecords":"All Support Tickets","cancel":"Cancel","confirm":"Confirm","covidNote1":"Please note that due to limited resources of the customer service team now, we will most likely result in delayed responses to all queries these days. Please rest assured that all queries will be attended to and we will do our utmost to handle all queries as quickly and efficiently as possible. We will do our best to reply to you within 1 days after you submit the ticket considering the existing backlog tickets queue. Please accept our apologies if this causes any inconvenience to you.","covidNote2":"In the meantime, should your issue be related to technical support, make sure to check out our extensive \u003c1\u003ewiki\u003c/1\u003e for all maintenance procedures, diagnoses and possible fixes. Also,  you can refer to these \u003c3\u003etips\u003c/3\u003e to get more efficient service.","createWorkOrder":"Technical Ticket","createResellerTicket":"New Reseller Ticket","technicalTicketPrinter":"Technical Ticket (Hardware)","technicalTicketSoftware":"Technical Ticket (Software)","technicalTicketFilament":"Technical Ticket (Filament \u0026 Maker's Supply)","delete":"Delete","deleteButton":"Delete","detailsButton":"Detail","addMoreButton":"Reply","evaluateButton":"Rate our service","device":"device","deviceId":"Printer SN","SNAdnLink":"\u003c0\u003eProduct SN \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e(\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eHow to get SN?\u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003e)\u003c/3\u003e","endTime":"End time","filament":"Filaments","material":"Materials","hmsCode":"HMS","hmsCodePlaceholder":"Enter \",\" to separate HMS","hmsCodeDesc":"8/16-bit error code like: 0300-0100-0001-000A.","assistant":"Assistant (HMS) Photo / Code ","assistantDesc":"You may find “Assistant“ on printer screen","assistantDesc1":"For X1C, H2D","assistantDesc2":"For A1, A1 mini","assistantPlaceholder":"You can type in Assistant Code as well，please separate with “,”","name":"Name","firstName":"First Name","lastName":"Last Name","resellerName":"Reseller name","orderId":"Order ID and Channel","orderIdDesc":"How to get Order ID?","orderIdNew":"Order ID","orderChannelNew":"Order Channel","trackingNumber":"Tracking Number","products":"Products","orderChannel":"Channel","orderChannels":{"officialOnlineStore":"Official Online Store","amazon":"Amazon","tikTok":"TikTok","reseller":"Authorized Reseller"},"logNotFound":"What to do if the log is not found?","noRecords":"No records","nothing":"nothing","filamentBatchNumber":"\u003c0\u003eFilament Batch Number / Serial Number \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e(\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eHow to get?\u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003e)\u003c/3\u003e","filamentBatchNumberLabel":"Filament Batch Number / Serial Number","filamentBatchNumberDesc":"Batch Number: Check the code on the left/right side of the box label.\nSerial Number: Load into AMS and check the screen for filament SN.","possibleFile":{"desc1":"\u003c0\u003eSelect the corresponding printer type and read the export method for the printer logs\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eX1 series\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eP1 series\u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003eA1 series\u003c/3\u003e","desc1New":"\u003c0\u003eSelect the corresponding printer type and read \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ethe export method for the printer logs\u003c/1\u003e","desc2":"\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eLog export method\u003c/1\u003e","desc3":"Under the ipcam folder of the SD card, you can find the video files named as follows: \u003c1\u003eipcam-record. [year-month-day-hour-minute].number.mp4\u003c/1\u003e, Please send any video clips which are related to the error.","title1":"\u003c0\u003e1. Printer log file\u003c/0\u003e","title2":"\u003c0\u003e2. Bambu PC Software log file\u003c/0\u003e","title3":"\u003c0\u003e3. Videos recorded by the built-in camera\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e (X1 series or P1 series with an added-on camera)\u003c/1\u003e","title4":"\u003c0\u003e4. The 3mf for printing (If sending prints via Bambu Studio, choose \"Export Sliced File\" instead of \"Print\".) or the lac file for making (Choose \"File\"-\u003e \"Save project\" on Bambu Suite)\u003c/1\u003e","title5":"\u003c0\u003e5. Other supporting documents such as photos, videos, documents, etc, which you think might be useful to diagnose the problem more precisely\u003c/0\u003e"},"fileDesc":{"desc1":"\u003c0\u003eHow to upload log files: \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eX1 series\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e \u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003eP1 series\u003c/3\u003e\u003c4\u003e \u003c/4\u003e\u003c5\u003eA1 series\u003c/5\u003e","desc1New":"\u003c0\u003eHow to upload log files: \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eX1 series\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e / \u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003eP1 series\u003c/3\u003e\u003c4\u003e / \u003c/4\u003e\u003c5\u003eA1 series\u003c/5\u003e","desc1Log":"\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eHow to upload log files?\u003c/1\u003e","desc2":"\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eHow to export Bambu PC Software log?\u003c/1\u003e","desc3":"Sharing a detailed photo or video of the reported issue will greatly expedite the resolution of your ticket.","desc4":"The 3mf for printing (If sending prints via Bambu Studio, choose \"Export Sliced File\" instead of \"Print\".) \nor the lac file for making (Choose \"File\"-\u003e \"Save project\" on Bambu Suite)","desc5":"Other materials that you believe may assist in a more accurate diagnosis of the problem, including photo