ouch with you"}},"purchaseOrder":{"title":"Purchase Inquiry","desc":"Please complete and submit this form, and a member of our sales team will reach out to contact you.","successTitle":"We have received your request!","successDesc":"Thank you for contacting us at Bambu Lab; a member of our sales team will reach out to you soon."},"taxExempt":{"title":"Apply for a Tax-Exempt account","desc":"Bambu Lab works with education, non-profit, and other organizations who qualify for tax-exempt status.","step1":{"title":"Here's how it works","desc1":"Fill out the online application form. Once approved, you may make tax-exempt purchases on behalf of the organizations online. The tax will be deducted directly at the time of purchase."},"step2":{"title":"Be sure you have:","desc1":"\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eA bambulab.com account\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e, If you don't already have a Bambu Lab account, you'll need to create one.\u003c/2\u003e","desc2":"\u003c0\u003eThe shipping information on the order \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003emust exactly match the state tax-exempt certificate\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e","desc3":"Tax exemption certificate in one of these formats: PDF, JPG, PNG or TIFF.","desc4":"\u003c0\u003eRead and understand the \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eConditions for Tax-Exempt\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e and the \u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003eConsumer Product Usage and Compliance Statement\u003c/3\u003e\u003c4\u003e.\u003c/4\u003e"},"signIn":"Log In","createAccount":"Create an account","label":{"account":{"title":"ACCOUNT INFORMATION","email":"Email Address","emailDesc":"This account and email address will be used for B2B account notifications and for logging in to the online store.","enterpriseType":"I want to apply as a reseller account.","enterpriseTypeDesc":"If you have already been in contact with our team and need to create a reseller B2B account, please check this option. Otherwise, please leave it unchecked."},"shipping":{"organizationTy