\u003c0\u003eI have read and agree to the \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eConditions for Tax-Exempt\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e and the \u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003eConsumer Product Usage and Compliance Statement\u003c/3\u003e\u003c4\u003e.\u003c/4\u003e","button":"I have read and agree to the conditions","eu":{"title":"Subject to you acknowledging and agreeing to the conditions below, you may submit that VAT registration number to apply for a Bambu Lab tax-exempt business account:","desc0":"The VAT registration number and the VAT registration certificate you submit to Bambu Lab EU web store belong to the business you operate, and that business is registered for VAT purposes;","desc1":"All transactions on your Bambu Lab EU web store account will be business-related transactions made by the business associated with the VAT registration number and VAT registration certificate you submit to Bambu Lab EU web store.","desc2":"Bambu Lab EU web store reserves the right to charge you any applicable unbilled VAT if you provide a VAT registration number that is determined to be invalid, or not in accordance with your business details."},"usa":{"title":"Subject to you acknowledging and agreeing to the conditions below, you may submit the valid sale tax certificate of exemption or other necessary supporting documents to apply for a Bambu Lab tax-exempt business account before placing the order:","desc0":"The valid sale tax certificate of exemption you submit to Bambu Lab US web store belongs to the business you operate, and the organization or company name and shipping address on the order must exactly match the state tax-exempt certificate;","desc1":"All transactions on your Bambu Lab US web store account will be business-related transactions made by the business associated with the exemption number and the certificate you submit to Bambu Lab US web store.","desc2":"You are liable for any tax and interest, and possible civil and criminal penalties imposed by the state, if you are not eligible to claim this exemption."}},"submit":"Submit","errorInProgress":"Each account can apply for a B2B account only once. You already have an application in progress. Please wait patiently for the review. If you have any questions, you may contact \u003ccustomerServiceLink\u003eCustomer Service\u003c/customerServiceLink\u003e.","errorAssociated":"Your account is already associated with an enterprise and cannot apply for a B2B account again. If you have any questions, you may contact \u003ccustomerServiceLink\u003eCustomer Service\u003c/customerServiceLink\u003e.","successTitle":"We have received your request!","successDesc":"It may take up to 5 business days for your application to be approved. You will receive the tax-exempt login portal via email upon approval and you can make tax-exempt purchases immediately with the account."},"filamentGuide":{"title":"Bambu Filament Guide","desc":"This filament guide offers a comprehensive comparison of properties, application, and printing requirements for Bambu filaments, aiming to help users select the best-suited material for needs. Compare up to 4 materials by ticking their checkboxes. For detailed technical information, download filament technical data sheets (TDS) on product pages.","descMobile":"This filament guide offers a comprehensive comparison of properties, application, and printing requirements for Bambu filaments, aiming to help users select the best-suited material for needs. For detailed technical information, download filament technical data sheets (TDS) on product pages.","download":"Download PDF","compare":{"title":"Compare:","all":"ALL"},"table":{"classification":{"filamentProperties":"Filament \nProperties","prePrintingPreparation":"Pre-printing \nPreparation","printerSettings":"Printer \nSettings","postPrintingProcesses":"Post-printing \nProcesses"},"row":{"toughness":{"title":"Toughness","subTitle":"Impact Strength - XY","unit":"kJ/m²","desc":"A material's ability to resist fracture when subjected to sudden, forceful impacts or collisions. It can be quantified by impact strength (XY)."},"strength":{"title":"Strength","subTitle":"Bending Strength - XY","unit":"MPa","desc":"The maximum bending stress a material can handle before breaking or reaching a certain deformation."},"stiffness":{"title":"Stiffness","unit":"MPa","subTitle":"Bending Modulus - XY","desc":"A material's ability to resist elastic deformation. It can be quantified by bending modulus (XY)."},"layerAdhesion":{"title":"Layer Adhesion","subTitle":"Impact Strength - Z","unit":"kJ/m²","desc":"The bonding strength in a print's Z direction. It can be quantified by impact strength (Z)."},"heatResistance":{"title":"Heat Resistance","subTitle":"HDT, 0.45 MPa","desc":"The temperature at which a material begins to deform under a specified load."},"saturatedWaterAbsorptionRate":{"title":"Saturated Water \nAbsorption Rate","subTitle":"25 ℃, 55% RH","desc":"The capacity to hold water when exposed to air, with higher values implying a greater tendency to absorb water."},"dryOutBeforeUse":{"title":"Dry Out Before Use","desc":"The need for drying depends on actual states of the filament received."},"dryingCondition":{"title":"Drying Condition"},"amsCompatibility":{"title":"AMS Compatibility"},"nozzleSizeMaterial":{"title":"Nozzle Size/Material"},"buildPlate":{"title":"Build Plate \n\u0026 Bed Temperature"},"adhesionMethods":{"title":"Adhesion Methods"},"printWithEnclosure":{"title":"Print with Enclosure","desc":"For high-temperature materials, it is recommended printing in an enclosed chamber to minimize warping and deformation during printing."},"sealWithDesiccant":{"title":"Seal with Desiccant","desc":"For moisture-sensitive materials, store filament in a sealed container with desiccant during printing to ensure optimal print quality."},"printSpeed":{"title":"Print Speed"},"nozzleTemperature":{"title":"Nozzle Temperature"},"bedTemperature":{"title":"Bed Temperature"},"partCoolingFan":{"title":"Part Cooling Fan","desc":"Fan speed highly depends on model size."},"annealing":{"title":"Annealing","desc":"A heat treatment process to improve the comprehensive mechanical properties and heat resistance of prints."}}}},"policies":{"privacyNotice":"Privacy Notice","termsOfUse":"Terms of Use","cookiePolicy":"Cookie Policy","keyTerms":"Key Terms","serviceProvidersOrPartners":"Service Providers or Partners","printingInformationStatement":"Printing Information Statement","catalogue":"Catalogue","updates":"Updates","privacyHistoryTips":"This is an archived version of our Privacy Notice.","selectRegions":{"title":"Select regions","US":{"text":"U.S.","desc":"If you live in the United States, this Privacy Notice will apply."},"uk":{"text":"EEA, UK and Switzerland","desc":"If you live in the European Economic Area, United Kingdom, or Switzerland, this Privacy Notice will apply."},"kr":{"text":"South Korea","desc":"If you live in South Korea, this Privacy Notice will apply."},"jp":{"text":"Japan","desc":"If you live in Japan, this Privacy Notice will apply."},"other":{"text":"Other regions","desc":"If you live outside of the United States, the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom, Switzerland, South Korea, or Japan, this Privacy Notice will apply."}}},"generalInquiry":{"title":"General Ticket","covidNote":"Please note that our response time over the weekends may be delayed, but we will get back to you as soon as possible.\nIf you do not receive a response within 3 days, please check your spam folder.\nIf you have a technical issue, please submit a ticket here:\u003c1\u003eTechnical ticket\u003c/1\u003e","privacyPolicy":"\u003c1\u003e* Uploading your related information helps us to solve your issues much more efficiently. Your privacy will be protected by \u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003ePrivacy Notice\u003c/2\u003e. Submitting the ticket indicates your agreement to the terms.","label":{"email":"Email","printerModel":"Printer Model (or Product)","product":"Product","issueType":"Issue Type-General","title":"Question","desc":"What is your question regarding?","upload":"+ Upload attachment","region":"Regions or Countries","name":"Name","resellerName":"Reseller name","phone":"Phone","orderId":"\u003c0\u003eOrder number: \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e(If you have placed an order and have an order number, please fill in)\u003c/1\u003e","orderIdDesc":"Please select the appropriate Region/Country and Order Channel. The corresponding Order ID associated with your account will be identified automatically. Alternatively, you may enter your order number manually.","sn":"\u003c0\u003eSN: \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e(If you have received the printer /AMS, please provide the SN, which is usually affixed to the shipping box)\u003c/1\u003e","address":"\u003c0\u003eCorrect address: \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e(If you feedback logistics problems or open box loss problems, please fill in the address, so that we can help you solve the problem faster)\u003c/1\u003e","addressText":"\u003c0\u003eCorrect address: \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e(If you're submitting a ticket for a logistics issue or missing items, please enter your address so we can assist you more efficiently.)\u003c/1\u003e"},"validationSchema":{"nameRequired":"Please fill in the Name","emailRequired":"Please fill in the Email","printerModelRequired":"Please select the Printer Model (or Product)","issueTypeRequired":"Please select the Issue Type-General","descRequired":"Please fill in the Description","regionRequired":"Please select the Region","resellerNameRequired":"Please fill in the Reseller name","phoneRequired":"Please fill in the Phone","orderIdRequired":"Please fill in the Order Id","snRequired":"Please fill in the SN","addressRequired":"Please fill in the Address","required":"Please enter","selectRequired":"Please select","max":"Maximum {{max}} characters allowed"}},"selectCountry":{"country":"Country / Region","language":"Language","title":"Select Your Country / Region","northAmerica":"North America","southAmerica":"South America","latinAmerica":"Latin America","Europe":"Europe","Asia":"Asia","other":"Other","recommended":"Recommended visit"},"cookieModal":{"consent_modal":{"title":"We use cookies","description":"When you visit our website, if you give your consent, we will use cookies and other tracking technologies to improve  your browsing experience on our website, to show you personalized content and targeted ads, to analyze our website traffic,  and to understand where our visitors are coming from. \u003cbr\u003eSelect an option or go to \u003ca href=\"#\" data-cc=\"c-settings\"\u003e\u003cb class=\"strong-font\"\u003eCookie Settings\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e to manage your preferences.More information on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/policies/cookie-policy\"\u003e\u003cb class=\"strong-font\"\u003eCookie Policy\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/policies/privacy\"\u003e\u003cb class=\"strong-font\"\u003ePrivacy Notice\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.","primary_btn":{"text":"Accept"},"secondary_btn":{"text":"Necessary only"}},"settings_modal":{"title":"Cookie Settings","save_settings_btn":"Save settings","accept_all_btn":"Accept all","blocks":{"1":{"description":"We use cookies on this website to provide you better services. For more information about how we use cookies and related technologies please see our \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/policies/cookie-policy\"\u003eCookie Policy\u003c/a\u003e. You can limit certain tracking or to decline cookies in relation to cookies which are not necessary, but please note that if you reject the use of certain types of cookies, some of the functions on our website may be affected and may not work correctly. Please note, you may need to refresh your page for your settings to take effect."},"2":{"title":"Strictly necessary cookies","description":"These cookies are essential for you to use our websites, such as the cookies used for carrying out the transmission of a communication, the cookies that record requests for information from the Internet and block web attacks so as to ensure web security, the cookies that are strictly necessary for us to provide information society services that you request. You must accept strictly necessary cookies to be able to use our websites."},"3":{"title":"Analytic/Performance Cookies","description":"These cookies allow us to recognize and count the number of visitors and to see how visitors navigate through our website and other service offerings, such as to see which pages you visit most, so as to help us improve the way our website and other service offerings work. "},"4":{"title":"Targeting Cookies","description":"These cookies record your visit to our website and other service offerings, the pages you have visited and the links you have followed. We will use this information to make our website, other service offerings and the advertising displayed on them (if any) more relevant to your interests. We may also share this information with third parties for this purpose."}}}},"accountSecurity":{"accountSecurity":"Account Security","changePassword":"Change Password","changeAccount":"Change Email Address","deleteAccount":"Delete Account","2StepVerification":"2-Step Verification","2StepVerificationDesc":"2-Step Authentication adds an extra layer of security to your account. It requires a 6-digit verification code during login. This helps protect your account from unauthorized access.","turnedOff":"Turned Off","turnedOn":"Turned On","boundDevice":"Devices","addNew":"Add New","rename":"Rename","delete":"Delete","passwordDialog":{"title":"Verify Your Password","content":"To protect your account security, please re-enter your password before continuing.","inputLabel":"Password","placeholder":"Enter password","confirmButton":"Go On"},"deviceNameDialog":{"title":"Add a device","content":"2-Step verification requires at least one device to provide verification codes. Name this device to help identify it from others.","inputLabel":"Device name","placeholder":"Enter Device name","confirmButton":"Go On","renameTitle":"Rename","renameDesc":"Rename this device.","renameConfirmButton":"Confirm"},"verificationDialog":{"1":{"title":"1. Install an authentication app","desc":"We recommend downloading Duo Mobile or Google Authenticator if you don't have one installed."},"2":{"title":"2. Scan this QR code or copy the key","desc":"Scan this QR code in the authentication app or copy the key and paste it in the authentication app.","copyTheKey":"Copy the Key"},"3":{"title":"3. Copy and enter 6-digit code","desc":"After the QR code is scanned or the key is entered, your authentication app will generate a 6-digit code. Copy the code, come back here, and enter it in the next step."},"title":"Setup 2-Step Verification","content":"After you turn on 2-Step Verification, in addition to entering your password, you need to complete another simple step to verify your identity.","confirmButton":"Next step"},"verificationCodeDialog":{"title":"Identity Verification","content":"Please enter the 6-digit verification code from the identity authentication app (Such as Google Authenticator, Duo Mobile).","confirmButton":"Confirm","unavailable":"Unavailable?","unavailableTitle":"2-Step Verification Unavailable","unavailableDesc":"\u003c0\u003eIf your 2-step verification is not available, please click the link to \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003econtact us\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e"},"finishDialog":{"title":"2-step verification is turned on!","content":"You can turn off 2-step verification at any time.","confirmButton":"Finish","deleteTitle":"This device is disabled.","deleteAllTitle":"2-step verification is turned off!"},"deleteDialog":{"deleteAllTitle":"Deactivate two-step verification","deleteAllContent":"Your account will no longer be protected by 2-step verification, you can reactivate 2-step verification at any time.","title":"Disable this device","content":"this will deactivate this device from your account.","confirmButton":"Deactivate"}},"emailPreferences":{"title":"Email Preferences","master":{"label":"Email subscriptions","desc":"Manage your email preferences for the Bambu Lab website and MakerWorld.","unsubscribedDesc":"You have unsubscribed from Bambu Lab website marketing emails and MakerWorld updates."},"bambulab":{"label":"Bambu Lab marketing emails","desc":"Receive the latest news, promotions, and product updates from the Bambu Lab website."},"makerworld":{"label":"MakerWorld updates","desc":"Receive creator updates, trending models, crowdfunding campaigns, and community news from MakerWorld.","manageTopics":"\u003c0\u003eNeed more control? \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eManage MakerWorld topics\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e"},"unsubscribeDialog":{"all":{"title":"Unsubscribe from all marketing emails and updates?","desc":"You will no longer receive marketing emails from the Bambu Lab website or updates from MakerWorld.","confirm":"Unsubscribe from all"},"bambulab":{"title":"Unsubscribe from Bambu Lab marketing emails?","desc":"You will no longer receive the latest news, promotions, or product updates from the Bambu Lab website.","confirm":"Unsubscribe"},"makerworld":{"title":"Unsubscribe from MakerWorld updates?","desc":"You will no longer receive updates from MakerWorld about creators, trending models, crowdfunding campaigns, or the community.","confirm":"Unsubscribe"}}},"changeAccount":{"emailVerification":"Email verification","emailReplace":"Change Email Address","currentEmail":"Currently Bound Email: {{email}}","desc":{"1":"After changing the email address associated with your account, our system will automatically update it across MakerWorld, Bambu Lab, and the Bambu Store.","2":"\u003c0\u003eIf you do not receive the verification code, please submit \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ea support ticket\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e","3":"\u003c0\u003eFor more details, please refer to \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ethe Email Address Change Rules\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e"},"form":{"email":{"placeholder":"Please enter a new Email Address","changed":"The Email address has been changed, please log in again.","error":{"associated":"This email address is already associated with another account. Please use a different email address. \nFor details, refer to the Email Address Change Rules.","incorrect":"The email format is incorrect. Please  enter a valid email address.","unavailable":"This email address is temporarily unavailable. Please try another email address."}},"code":{"placeholder":"Verification Code","codeButton":"Send Code","resendButton":"Resend Code","time":"{{second}}s","error":{"incorrect":"The verification code is incorrect, please re-enter it","expired":"The email verification code has expired. Please click the \"Send Code\" to resend the code.","failed":"Failed to send the verification code. Please try again later or contact customer support."}}},"rule":{"title":"Email Address Change Rules","desc":"To change your email address (\"Email Address 1\") associated with your account (\"Account 1\"), you’ll need to remove email address associated with your account and add a new email address (\"Email Address 2\").","note":"Note","noteText":{"1":"1. To ensure you can access to all products and services offered by MakerWorld and Bambu Lab seamlessly, MakerWorld and Bambu Lab (include Bambu Store) use a unified account management system.When you initiate and complete the process of changing your email address, our system will automatically update it accross MakerWorld and Bambu Lab.","2":"2. In the Bambu Lab \u0026 MakerWolrd account system, each email address can only be linked to a single account. If the Email Address 2 is already associated with an existing Bambu Lab and/or MakerWorld account （\"Account 2\"), we are unable to modify it directly. To proceed, you may either: \n①Select a new different email address (\"Email Address 3\") to associate with Account 1; or \n②Delete the Account 2 that is currently associated with Email Address 2.","3":"3. Once the email change process is initiated, we will send a verification code to your current email address to verify your identity. If you are unable to receive the verification code at your current email, please submit a support ticket, and our customer service team will assist you in updating your account's bound email."}}},"customFirmwarePlan":{"title":"Join the Third Party Firmware Plan","joinedByYouLabel":"Joined 3D printers","joinedByYouNoData":"You have no joined printer.","joinLable":"Please select the X1 or X1C 3D printer","noPrinter":"No printers available to join. The printer needs to be bound to your Bambu Account before proceeding.","joinedByOthers":"Joined","privacy":"\u003c0\u003eI acknowledge that I have read and agreed with the \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e{{privacyName}}\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e","joinButton":"Join the Third Party Firmware Plan","validation":{"printer":"Please select a printer to join.","privacy":"You need to agree with the {{privacyName}} before continuing."},"noticeModal":{"IGotIt":"I Got It","scrollAndRead":"Scroll down for more","agreeText":"I Agree","readText":"\u003c0\u003eI have read and understood the \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e{{privacyName}} above\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e"},"planModal":{"next":"Next","readText":"I have read and understand the above guidelines."},"confirmModal":{"desc":"I hereby confirm and fully agree to the stated terms and risks of the Third Party Firmware Plan.","cancel":"Cancel","confirm":"Join"},"joinedModal":{"title":"Joined Successfully","desc":"\u003c0\u003eYour 3D printer \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e{{device}}\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e has successfully joined the Third Party Firmware Plan. Please restart the printer and update to the official rootable firmware.\u003c/2\u003e","cancel":"Homepage","confirm":"Continue to Join"}},"betaFirmwareProgram":{"title":"Beta Firmware Program","desc":"\u003cp\u003eAfter joining, you might receive the beta version firmware on \u003cb\u003eALL\u003c/b\u003e your device. You will be able to shape Bambu Lab firmware by testing beta version and sharing your valuable feedback.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease note that you might be in queue to receive the beta version if the beta user number reaches the limit.\u003c/p\u003e","privacy":"\u003c0\u003eI agree to the \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eBeta firmware program terms\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e","join":"Join","quit":"Quit Beta Program","feedback":"Beta Feedback","joinSuccess":"You've joined Beta Firmware Program.","exitSuccess":"Exit Successful","model":{"title":"Confirm to quit Beta Program?","desc":"If you quit,you will no longer have early access to Beta features.","confirm":"Confirm to Quit","cancel":"Cancel"}},"aoneRecall":{"title":"Bambu Lab A1 Printer Recall Registration","submitWarningText":"One opportunity to submit the form, please confirm","header":{"declareList":["Dear Customer of A1/A1 Combo,","Thank you for purchasing products from Bambu Lab. We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience our product may have caused. In accordance with our \u003ca href=\"https://blog.bambulab.com/a1-recall-update/\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eofficial policy\u003c/a\u003e, we strongly urge all customers to stop using their A1 printers until the issue has been resolved.","We kindly request that you carefully review the following options and consider them before choosing the one that best suits your preference. ","Please note customers who purchase from our official resellers should receive the same compensation through the reseller. Please contact them for details."],"optionList":["\u003cb\u003eOption 1:\u003c/b\u003e Return the A1/A1 Combo and receive a full refund, including a \u003cb\u003e$80\u003c/b\u003e discount code.\u003cbr/\u003e We will promptly process the refund and provide you with the $80 discount code once the returned printer arrives to us. This discount can be used towards the purchase of the A1 Mini, P1, and X1 series, and will also apply to the A1 once it becomes available around May.","\u003cb\u003eOption 2:\u003c/b\u003e Keep the A1 printer and receive a revised heatbed and a \u003cb\u003e$120\u003c/b\u003e discount code. \u003cbr/\u003e  The revised heatbed will be shipped to you around end of March, accompanied by the $120 discount code. You can use this discount code for purchases of any product available in our online store. We would also want to mention that the warranty period in this case is increased with an additional \u003cb\u003e6 months \u003c/b\u003e of coverage.","Also note that in some countries, due to regulations, this self-replacement of the bed by the customer may not be an option and in this case the only solution is to return the printer for a refund."],"noticeList":["\u003cb\u003eImportant Notice:\u003c/b\u003e","\u003cb\u003e1. Please carefully consider your options and submit the form with caution. Each user can only submit the form once through this page, and it is important to confirm that all the information is accurate.\u003c/b\u003e","2. For packing information, please check the \u003ca href='https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/a1/manual/pack-a1-combo' target='_blank'\u003e A1 Combo \u003c/a\u003e / \u003ca href='https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/a1/manual/pack-a1' target='_blank'\u003e A1 \u003c/a\u003e wiki articles for your reference.","3. We have prepared guidance with steps for \u003ca  href='https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/a1/maintenance/heatbed' target='_blank'\u003e replacing the heatbed \u003c/a\u003e on our Wiki.","4. The voucher amount provided will be different for other regions, but equivalent discounts will be provided across different stores and regions to match the same value. ","5. After submitting this registration form, a ticket will be automatically generated for you. \u003cbr /\u003e You can check our response by accessing the corresponding ticket in the \u003ca href='https://bambulab.com/my/support/tickets' target='_blank'\u003e Support Ticket section \u003c/a\u003e from our website or in the Bambu Handy APP.","6. To ensure a smooth service experience, we will process your requests in batches upon receiving your feedback. We will strive to contact you as soon as possible and appreciate your patience.","7. For information about the use of the discount code, please refer to the detailed terms and conditions provided by our Bambu Store and the Official Reseller information.","8. We will adhere to our \u003ca href=\"/policies/privacy\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePrivacy Notice\u003c/a\u003e for the processing of your personal data.","9. \u003ca href=\"https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/a1/troubleshooting/a1-recall-faq\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eFrequently Asked Questions\u003c/a\u003e"]},"form":{"orderId":"Order No.","solution":"solution","orderChannel":"Purchase Channel","userName":"Last Name","firstName":"First Name","phoneNumber":"Phone Number","countryRegion":"Country/Region","address1":"Address","address2":"Address2","city":"City","province":"State/Province","zipCode":"Zip code","sn":"A1 Product SN","provincePlaceholder":"Input City if not applicable","howToGetSN":" How To Get Product SN "},"validate":{"snRepeat":"Serial Number can not be duplicated","snEmpty":"Serial Number can not be empty","singleSnError":"Serial Number is incorrect(Start with 039 and requires 15 digits)","singleSn6thError":"This Serial Number does not fall within the recall batch. Recall Scope: A1 printers sold between Nov 8, 2023 and Jan 27, 2024 with \"A\" as the 6th digit of the Serial Number.","orderIdRepeat":"Order No. can not be duplicated","orderIdEmpty":"Order No can not be empty","solutionEmpty":"Solution can not be empty","userNameEmpty":"Last Name can not be empty","firstNameEmpty":"First Name can not be empty","phoneNumberEmpty":"Phone Number can not be empty","countryEmpty":"Country/Region can not be empty","addressEmpty":"Address can not be empty","cityEmpty":"City can not be empty","provinceEmpty":"Can not be empty, Input City if not applicable","zipCodeEmpty":"Zip code can not be empty","orderChannelEmpty":"Purchase Channel can not be empty"},"solutionList":["Option 1: Return for Refund","Option 2: Wait for heatbed availability and replace it"],"confirm":"Each user can only submit one application. Please ensure your submission is correct","successDesc":"Thank you for submitting your request! We will handle it as soon as possible."},"filament":{"overview":"Overview","compare":"Compare","feedbackNeeded":"Feedback Needed","searchPlaceholder":"Browse All Filament","basicInformation":{"title":"Basic Information:","budgetFriendly":"Budget-Friendly","printability":"Printability","stiffness":"Stiffness","heatResistance":"Heat Resistance","impactStrength":"Impact Strength"},"commonApplications":"Applications:","pros":"Pros","cons":"Cons","colors":"Colors:","shopNow":"Shop Now","downloadTDS":"Download TDS","sampleProjects":"Sample Projects","printingTips":"Advanced Printing Tips","rankBy":"Rank by:","selected":"Selected:","usageScenarios":"Usage Scenarios","advancedPrintingTips":"Advanced Printing Tips","collections":{"desc":"Explore high-performance filaments like ABS, PETG, PA, and PC beyond PLA. Navigate categories below to find your perfect match.","applications":"Applications","applicationsDesc":"Choose the scenario that best fits your project needs to receive relevant recommendations and comparisons.","properties":"Properties","propertiesDesc":"Select the filament properties most essential to your project to receive relevant recommendations and comparisons.","safeties":"Tested for Safety","safetiesDesc":"Select filaments with extra peace of mind. Our filaments undergo certified testing for toy safety, food-contact scenarios, and low emissions—so you can print with greater confidence in everyday use.","printers":"Supported Filament","printersDesc":"Explore the range of filament types compatible with different Bambu printers for versatile and high-quality prints.","showMore":"Show More","hideMore":"Hide More","medal":{"good":"*Good: Strength \u003e 120 MPa and stiffness \u003e 4000 MPa","excellent":"*Excellent: Strength \u003e 140 MPa and stiffness \u003e 7000 MPa","optimal":"*Optimal: Strength \u003e 180 MPa and stiffness \u003e 8000 MPa"},"pla":{"title":"Start your 3D printing journey with PLA","desc":"Versatile, easy to print, and low-cost, PLA is our recommended filament for users with conventional performance requirements.","button":"Explore PLA"}},"medal":{"good":"Good","excellent":"Excellent","optimal":"Optimal"},"comparePage":{"title":"Select the filaments you want to compare","selected":"Selected:"}},"company":{"contactUs":{"title":"Contact Us","subTitle":"Get to us in a way that better suits your situation.","contacts":{"title":"Contacts","card1":{"title":"Customer Support","subTitle":"Get help from online support","link1":"Products support","link2":"Tech support","contact":"Contact us"},"card2":{"title":"Influencer \u0026 Media","subTitle":"Marketing collaboration"},"card3":{"title":"Corporate Sales","subTitle":"Submit a B2B purchase order or apply for a tax-exempt account","link1":"Business purchases","businessInquiryTitle":"Business Consultation","businessInquiryDesc":"Contact our sales team B2B purchase inquiry."},"card4":{"title":"Talent Recruitment","subTitle":"\u003c0\u003eFind your next role \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eHERE\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e or email\u003c/2\u003e"},"card5":{"title":"Business Opportunities","subTitle":"Become a reseller","link1":"Partner with us"},"card6":{"title":"Supply Chain","subTitle":"Apply to become a Bambu Lab supplier","link1":"Partner with us"},"card7":{"title":"Other General Inquiries","subTitle":"For general inquiries and information not covered by other categories.","text":"(This email is not for order, product, or technical inquiries. Please choose the correct category above to ensure your request is directed to the right team for a prompt response. Thank you for your understanding.)","desc":"\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eThis email is not intended for inquiries about orders or business matters.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e We kindly request that you submit a support ticket or utilize the contact methods provided above. This will help us to direct your request to the appropriate team, ensuring a timely and accurate response. Thank you for your understanding.\u003c/2\u003e","title1":"Feedback and Suggestion","subTitle1":"For a prompt response, please use the appropriate support channel listed above. This email is available for general feedback, suggestions, and any other matters not covered above."},"card8":{"title":"Business Collaboration","subTitle":"We welcome brands, IP holders, creators, and organizations from around the world to join the Bambu Lab ecosystem and explore the limitless possibilities of 3D printing together. For business collaborations, please contact:"}}},"joinUs":{"title":"Join Us","subTitle":"Let's make a dent in the universe!","teams":{"card1":{"title":"Join China Team","desc":"Join our dynamic team in Shenzhen or Shanghai and explore limitless career possibilities. Immerse yourself in a youthful, self-driven environment where you'll continuously push boundaries and grow your career.","buttonText":"Explore"},"card2":{"title":"Join Global Team","desc":"Bambu Lab's business spans the globe. There are no restrictions on work location, allowing for remote work, and it provides a warm and comprehensive lifecycle service to a vast number of users worldwide.","buttonText":"Explore"},"card3":{"title":"Campus Recruiting","desc":"Aimed at interns and recent graduates, Bambu Lab offers opportunities to participate in projects from the ground up, from 0 to 1. We are eager for fresh talent with imagination and creativity to join us.","buttonText":"Explore"}},"jobs":{"title":"Explore the jobs for you","card1":{"title":"R\u0026D","address":"Shenzhen/Shanghai","desc":"Our business lines cover 3D printers, filaments, software applications, and model content platforms. We engage in top-tier technical challenges within the industry, tackling difficulties and continuously improving, exploring the limits and the unknown.","link1":"Learn More"},"card2":{"title":"Supply Chain","address":"Shenzhen","desc":"It includes various positions such as procurement, supplier quality management, and production planning management. By bridging research and development creativity with manufacturing, we ensure an efficient and seamless supply chain.","link1":"Learn More"},"card3":{"title":"Marketing \u0026 Sales","address":"Shenzhen/Global","desc":"This includes positions in China and Global market operations, online and offline sales, and video creativity. We disseminate creativity in multiple ways, penetrate frontline markets, and bring Bambu Lab products into thousands of households.","link1":"Learn More"},"card4":{"title":"Customer Relations","address":"Shenzhen/Global","desc":"This includes various roles such as e-commerce support, technical support, spare parts operations, and service operations. We are dedicated to building diverse service channels and tools to provide professional lifecycle services to users worldwide.","link1":"Learn More"},"card5":{"title":"Logistics","address":"Shenzhen","desc":"It includes end-to-end logistics positions such as first-mile, last-mile, overseas warehouses, and planning. In response to the increasingly complex international logistics environment, we provide high-quality and reliable logistics support to customers worldwide.","link1":"Learn More"},"card6":{"title":"Products","address":"Shenzhen/Shanghai","desc":"Our business is divided into two lines: To C and To B. The To C line plans product routes and provides an exceptional user experience, while the To B line leads enterprise information system construction and process development to enhance organizational efficiency.","link1":"Learn More"},"card7":{"title":"Design","address":"Shenzhen/Shanghai","desc":"Positions in industrial design, visual design, and interaction design. We explore multi-disciplinary design communication, deeply integrating product aesthetics with user experience to make great design resonate with people.","link1":"Learn More"},"card8":{"title":"Manufacturing","address":"Shenzhen","desc":"We focus on every stage of product introduction. From conceptual design to engineering validation, from process optimization to production launch, we continuously enhance product quality to ensure a smooth market entry.","link1":"Learn More"},"card9":{"title":"Functional Support","address":"Shenzhen","desc":"It covers multiple fields including human resources, administration, finance, legal affairs, and more. By professionally empowering organizational efficiency, we create a better platform for the company, serving as a solid backbone for efficient operations.","link1":"Learn More"}}}},"challenge":{"home":{"banner":{"title":"Why I Print","desc":"Share Your 3D Printing Story","submitButton":"Submit Now","checkSubmission":"Check Submission"},"tab":{"title":"Bambu Maker Challenge","introduction":"Introduction","themes":"Themes","join":"How to Join","awards":"Awards","prizes":"Prizes","gallery":"Gallery","inspirations":"Inspirations","faq":"FAQ","submit":"Submit"},"introduction":{"desc1":"The heart of the Bambu community is YOU—our creators who push 3DP boundaries. Your projects make 3D printing exciting and full of possibilities. Now, it's your time to shine! ","desc2":"\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e#BambuLetsMakeIt\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e is for everyone. Share your creations, inspire others, and win up to $500. Your work could be showcased to makers worldwide! Upload yours NOW!\u003c/2\u003e"},"themes":{"title":"Find the Ideal Theme for Your Creativity","desc":"\u003c0\u003eReady to show off your creativity? Make sure to tag \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e#BambuLetsMakeIt\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e and one of these subtopics on social media\u003c/2\u003e","submit":"Submit Now"},"storys":{"title":"Your Story Matters","desc":"We want to see and hear your 3D printing journey! Tell us:"},"join":{"1":{"title":"Create and Share","desc":"\u003cspan\u003eShare a video of yourself with your favorite creation, tell your personal \u003cbold\u003e#WhyIPrint\u003c/bold\u003e story, and post it on Instagram, Facebook, X (Twitter), or TikTok.\nMake sure your post includes the \u003cbold\u003e#WhyIPrint\u003c/bold\u003e hashtag and tags the official Bambu Lab account.\u003c/span\u003e"},"2":{"title":"Submit Your Entry","desc":"Visit our submission page located on the official website banner.\nUpload your post's link and media files.\nAdd your story, contact information, and other relevant details."},"3":{"title":"You're In!","desc":"Watch for weekly featured stories.\nStay tuned for winner announcements via official social media and personal email."},"title":"How to Join"},"award":{"title":"Awards"},"gallery":{"title":"See What Makers Are Printing","desc":"Got a story to share? Show us your creations and inspire others!"},"faq":{"title":"FAQ"},"conditions":"\u003c0\u003eSee Bambu #WhyIPrint \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eterms + conditions\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e for more details.\u003c/2\u003e"},"record":{"title":"Check Submission","table":{"theme":"Submission Theme","phase":"Submission Phase","time":"Submission Time","contentLink":"Submission Link","status":"Award Status","phaseLabel":"Phase {{phaseCount}}","status0":"Being Reviewed","status1":"Thanks for Participating","status2":"Award Winning"}},"submission":{"title":"Bambu #WhyIPrint Submission Form","contentInfo":"Content Info","yourInfo":"Your Info","theme":"Content Theme","type":"Content Type","product":"Product","platform":"Platform","multiple":"(multiple choice)","original":"Are the prints in the video your original work?","originalDesc":"If not, please credit the original creator in your post.","contentLink":"Content Link","modelLink":"Model Link","contentLinkPlaceholder":"Please upload the link to your content on your social media platform.","modelLinkPlaceholder":"Please upload a link to the model used in your work if it is NOT your original creation.","uploadFiles":"Upload Files","uploadFilesDesc":"Video: 500MB max, 1080p preferred. Image: 10MB max. Total files: 10 max.","uploadFilesType":"MOV/MP4 JPG/PNG","contentDescription":"Content Description","contentDescriptionDesc":"Share the stories behind your great work or any thoughts about 3D printing! Bambu community always welcomes your voice!","contentDescriptionPlaceholder":"Please describe your content in {{count}} characters.","firstName":"First Name","lastName":"Last Name","email":"Email","emailDesc":"Please provide a valid email address; this is how we'll contact you if you win.","profile":"Social Media Profile","provicy":"\u003c0\u003eI understand and agree to \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eTerms and Conditions\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e\u003c/2\u003e","submit":"Submit","typeData":{"photo":"Photo","video":"Video"},"validationSchema":{"required":"Please complete this required field","selectRequired":"Please select this required field","fileRequired":"Please select video or image","allFileRequired":"Please select file","emailError":"Please confirm your email","linkError":"Please fill in the correct link","max":"Maximum {{max}} characters allowed","imgMaxSize":"Image: {{size}} max","videoMaxSize":"Video: {{size}} max","fileMaxSize":"Other Files: {{size}} max","filemaxCount":"Total files: {{count}} max","fileType":"Please upload the correct file","agree":"Please agree to Terms and Conditions","error":"Submission failed, please try again."},"successModal":{"title":"Success!\n Your Submission is In!","desc":"Thank you for sharing your story with us! Your content has been successfully submitted and is now part of the Bambu Lab #WhyIPrint Program.","button":"Check Submission"}},"makeIt":{"home":{"prizes":{"title":"Prizes","desc":"\u003cbold\u003eNo Restrictions\u003c/bold\u003e on Work \u0026 \u003cbold\u003eNo Limits\u003c/bold\u003e on Winners. Everyone and every work is welcome!"},"gallery":{"title":"See What Makers Are Printing","desc":"Got a project to share? Show your creations and inspire the community!"},"conditions":"\u003c0\u003eSee #BambuLetsMakeIt \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eterms + conditions\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e for more details.\u003c/2\u003e"},"submission":{"title":"#BambuLetsMakeIt Submission Form","successModel":{"title":"Success! You're In!","desc":"Thank you for sharing your story with us! Your content has been successfully submitted and is now part of #BambuLetsMakeIt.","button":"Check Submission"}}},"fund":{"home":{"banner":{"title":"Let's Make It Fund","submitButton":"Submit Now","submitNow":"Submit Now","checkSubmission":"Check My Submission"},"introduction":{"fullScreenText":"\u003cfullScreenContent\u003e\u003cfullScreenKeywordsTitle\u003eUp to\u003c/fullScreenKeywordsTitle\u003e\u003cfullScreenKeywords\u003e$300,000\u003c/fullScreenKeywords\u003e\u003cfullScreenKeywordsDesc\u003eto bring your ambition to life.\u003c/fullScreenKeywordsDesc\u003e\u003c/fullScreenContent\u003e","text":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOur story started with your support — \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003enow, we want to help write yours.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe “Let's Make It Fund” is created for makers, by makers. We're dedicating resources to bring your most ambitious ideas to life — projects that push boundaries, inspire innovation, and empower others — \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ewith grants of up to generally \u003c/span\u003e\u003ckeywords\u003e\u003ckeywordsText\u003e$300,000\u003c/keywordsText\u003e{{fullScreenText}}\u003c/keywords\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLet's make it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},"howItWorks":{"1":"Prepare your proposal.","2":"Submit to us.","3":"If selected, let's make it!","title":"How It Works?"},"lookingFor":{"title":"What Projects Are We Looking For?","desc":"We look for projects that are either \u003ckeywords\u003eExceptional\u003c/keywords\u003e or \u003ckeywords\u003eEnlightening\u003c/keywords\u003e. \nBut regardless of which, the selected projects should be \u003ckeywords\u003eExecutionable\u003c/keywords\u003e.","items":{"1":{"title":"Exceptional","desc":"Projects that not only demonstrate master-level skill but also redefine what is possible.These are the ideas that only a handful of people could even attempt, pushing the very boundaries to create what was once though impossible.","author":"Footage by @神奇阿宇Ayu, @Xyla Foxlin, @FliteTest, and @Hacksmith Industries."},"2":{"title":"Enlightening","desc":"If any chance, let's make the world a little bit better - contributes to the great good, or actually benefits at least a group of people needed.","author":"Footage by @哔哩小宇吖, @Owen来造, @爱无疆WCWS."},"3":{"title":"Executionable","desc":"You should have a clear project roadmap, demonstrating where to start and how to bring your idea to life. The inclusion of any demos or periodic outcomes is preferred.","author":"Footage by @Alexandre Chappel, @Joel Creates, and @PeterSripol."}}},"get":{"title":"Once Selected, You May Get:","items":{"1":"Financial Support","2":"Promotion Support","3":"Supply Chain Support","4":"And more..."}},"toBetter":{"title":"To Better Prepare Your Proposal:","submitNow":"Submit Now","items":{"1":{"title":"One Idea","desc":"What do you want to build/make/create?"},"2":{"title":"Realization Plan","desc":"How to bring your idea to life through personal manufacturing tool?"},"3":{"title":"Forecasted Result","desc":"How would it look like when your idea comes true? Provide anything that can be a reference!"},"4":{"title":"Resources You Need","desc":"Money, printers, experts...Go as detailed as you can think of!"}}},"faq":{"title":"FAQ"}},"record":{"title":"Check Submission","table":{"id":"Submission ID","time":"Submission Time","status":"Status","status0":"Submitted","status1":"Selected","status2":"Not selected, thanks for the efforts!","status3":"In Contact","noData":"You have not submitted any applications yet."}},"submission":{"title":"Let's Make It Fund Application Form","info":{"title":"Personal Information","desc":"Team applicants may only submit the name and email of their designated team representative.\nTo ensure the authenticity of project applications and prevent fraudulent information, this questionnaire requires real-name registration.\nYour name is collected solely for internal verification and eligibility assessment of this specific project, and is a necessary step for processing subsequent procedures.","name":"Full Name","contact":"Contact Information","contactDesc":"Please fill in valid contact information (email address/mobile phone number/wechat ID).  If your submission is selected, we will contact you through this contact information. ","email":"Email Address","emailDesc":"Please provide a valid email address; this is how we'll contact you if you proposal is selected.","socialLinks":"Social Media Profile Link(s)","socialLinksDesc":"Please include links to the platforms where you showcase your previous work — for example, YouTube, Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, GitHub, or your personal website.","socialLinkPlaceholder":"One link at a time, maximum 10 links."},"description":{"title":"Project Description","projectDesc":"Tell us about your project! What inspired it, and how does it capture the maker spirit? Does it solve a real-world problem or bring a new idea to life?","upload":"Please include any supporting or reference materials that illustrate your project. You may upload pictures, sketches, renders, or model files.","uploadDesc":"Supported format: JPG/PNG/PDF/STL/OBJ/MP4/MOV/AVI/MKV.\n[Video: 500MB max. Image: 10MB max. Other files: 500MB max. Total file number: up to 20.]","uploadSupportFile":"JPG/PNG/PDF/STL/OBJ/MP4/MOV/AVI/MKV","uploadPlaceholder":"File Description"},"plan":{"title":"Project Execution Plan","plan1":"Describe your project roadmap. Outline where you will begin, the steps you’ll take along the way, and the technologies or tools you plan to use (e.g., 3D printing, laser cutting, etc.).","plan2":"Describe the most difficult part of your project—whether it’s a specific component or step. How do you plan to tackle it?","plan3":"Please describe the resources needed for your project, including but not limited to budget, equipment, technical support, or any other tools and materials required.","plan4":"Assuming all the resources you mentioned above are provided, please estimate how long it will take you to complete the project."},"introduction":{"title":"Maker Introduction","selfIntroduction":"We'd love to get to know you better. Tell us a little about yourself and why you believe you should be selected for the Let's Make It Fund.","selfIntroductionPlaceholder":"Do not provide here any personal information that may identify or recognize you, such as email address, phone number or physical address.","modelingSkills":{"label":"How to describe your modeling skills?","options":{"1":"I am a beginner and can follow basic tutorials.","2":"I have intermediate skills and can create more complex models.","3":"I am advanced and can design detailed and customized models.","4":"I am an expert and can teach or guide others in modeling.","5":"Others, please decribe:_____"}},"filmingSkills":{"label":"How to describe your filming skills?","options":{"1":"I am a beginner and have minimal experience.","2":"I have intermediate skills and can film decent videos.","3":"I am advanced and can produce high-quality, well-edited videos.","4":"I am an expert and can teach or guide others in filming techniques.","5":"Others, please decribe:_____"}}},"privacy":"I understand and agree to the \u003ctermsLink\u003eTerms and Conditions\u003c/termsLink\u003e and \u003cprivacyLink\u003ePrivacy Notice\u003c/privacyLink\u003e.","successModel":{"title":"Submitted Successfully!","desc":"Congratulations! You have successfully submitted your project.","button":"Check Submission"}}}},"academy":{"common":{"serverError":"Server Error","noContent":"No Content Yet","beginner":"Beginner","intermediate":"Intermediate","advanced":"Advanced","academy":"Bambu Lab Academy","quiz":"Quiz","chapter":"Chapter","latestLearned":"Last Learned","courseCompleted":"🎉 Completed","courseProgress":"Completed \u003c1\u003e{{progress}}\u003c/1\u003e Chapters","readTime":"Estimated reading time: {{time}} min","review":"Review","start":"Start","continue":"Continue","enter":"Enter","back":"Back","faq":"Frequently Asked Questions","navigation":"Navigation","prevChapter":"Previous Chapter","nextChapter":"Next Chapter","takeQuiz":"Take Quiz","takeCourseQuiz":"Take Course Quiz","incorrect":"Incorrect","tryAgain":"Try Again","rateCourse":"Rate Course","exploreFeatures":"Explore Features","features":"Features","autoTranslate":"This content has been automatically translated.","originalContent":"The original content has been displayed.","showOriginal":"Show original text","translate":"Translate","newContent":"New content is available for learning.","chapterList":"Chapter List","newContentDesc":"The following content is newly added course material. You may choose to study it independently, but completing it will not increase your points."},"entry":{"intro":"Explore beginner-friendly academy courses designed specifically around your Bambu Lab 3D printer. These courses simplify the learning process, making it easier to understand and use your printer while helping you enhance your 3D printing skills.","welcome":"Welcome to Bambu Lab Academy!","selectPrinter":"Select Your Printer Model to get Started","selectCourse":"Select Your Course to get Started","videoGuides":"Video Guides"},"home":{"popularCourses":"Popular Courses","myLearning":"My Academy","viewAll":"view all","completed":"Completed","selectToStart":"Select a Course to Get Started","myProgress":"Progress","courseProgress":"Course Progress","resume":"Resume"},"bookmark":{"bookmark":"Bookmark","savedToMyLearning":"Saved to \u003c1\u003eMy Learning\u003c/1\u003e","unsaved":"Unsaved successfully","error":"Something went wrong. Please try again.","remove":"Remove bookmark","offlineTip":"The current content has been taken down and is unavailable"},"quiz":{"quizHint":"You can find the right answer by \u003c1\u003ereading this chapter\u003c/1\u003e.","answerAnalysis":"Answer Explanation","continueLearning":"Continue Learning","getCertificate":"Get Certificate","quizCompleted":"🎉 Amazing job! You aced the quiz with a perfect score—well done!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe'd love to hear your thoughts! Please take a moment to rate this course level, and share your feedback.","quizCompletedShort":"👏 Congratulations! You got it!","courseCompletedTitle":"Course Completed!","courseCompletedDesc":"Amazing job! We'd love to hear your thoughts to help us improve.","single":"\u003c0\u003eSingle Choice\u003c/0\u003e - Only one answer can be selected","multiple":"\u003c0\u003eMultiple Choice\u003c/0\u003e - More than one answer can be selected"},"review":{"entryTitle":"Review Quiz","entrySubtitle":"Recap key 3D print concepts","prev":"Previous","next":"Next","finish":"Finish"},"chapter":{"chapterQuizPromptTitle":"Chapter Quiz","chapterQuizPromptDesc":"Complete chapter quiz before starting next chapter.","courseQuizPromptTitle":"Course Quiz","courseQuizPromptDesc":"Read all the chapters and complete all chapter quiz questions before taking the course quiz."},"rate":{"title":"Please Rate Your Course Module Experience","rateCourseExperience":"How was your learning experience?","howToImprove":"What can we improve to make your experience better for future courses?","like":"Good","dislike":"Bad","optionEnumContent":"Content","optionEnumUI":"User Interface","optionEnumMoreImages":"More images","optionEnumVideos":"Videos","optionEnumMoreDetailedSteps":"More detailed steps","feedbackPlaceholder":"Please add your suggestions","contentFit":"Does the content fit your learning expectations?","courseTitle":"How was your experience with the current course level?","chapterTitle":"How would you rate this course chapter?","chapterImprove":"What can we improve to make it better?","improveNext":"What can be improved for future courses?","justRight":"Yes, it's just right","moreBasics":"I would like more basic content","moreAdvanced":"I would like more advanced content","praticalExamples":"Practical examples","guides":"Step-by-step guides","betterVisuals":"Better visuals","ui":"Smoother UI","topics":"Broader topics","feel1":"Very Bad","feel2":"Bad","feel3":"Average","feel4":"Good","feel5":"Very Good","feelRequired":"please select an option"},"terms":{"title":" Information About Academy Terms of Service"},"certificate":{"title":"Bambu Lab Academy Certificate of Completion","downloadCertificate":"Download Certificate","downloadPdf":"Download PDF","downloadPng":"Download PNG","download3mf":"Download 3mf","nameLabel":"Simply provide the information below, and we'll generate your personalized certificate to celebrate your accomplishment.","encouragement":"Congratulations on successfully completing the Bambu Lab \u003c1\u003e {{name}} \u003c/1\u003e Academy Course! Your dedication and enthusiasm for learning are truly commendable.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e As a token of your achievement, you can now download your custom certificate of completion.","confirmTips":"Once you submit your name, it can't be edited.","nameValidate":"Character limit 16, please retype","namePlaceholder":"Please fill in your name (Charater Limit 16)","nameTips":"You can preview your certificate style below to make sure your name doesn't go over the certificate page.","genrateBtn":"Certificate of completion","loading":"Preparing model. Please wait"},"requestContent":{"tooltip":"Request new content","title":"Request New Content","description":"We're always looking to improve the content available to support your 3D printing journey. If you couldn't find what you were looking for, or you have an idea for something new, let us know by filling out the form below.","contentType":{"label":"Content Type","helper":"Choose the format of content you'd like to request.","video":"Video Format","written":"Written Format"},"category":{"label":"Category","helper":"Select the category that best matches your request.","printing3D":"3D Printing","laser":"Laser Engraving \u0026 Cutting","hardware":"Hardware (Printer Components)","software":"Software (Studio, Handy, etc)","other":"Other"},"printerModel":{"label":"Printer Model","helper":"Choose the printer model this content request is for.","placeholder":"Select your printer"},"requestDetails":{"label":"Request Details","helper":"The more context you provide, the easier it is for us to create something useful and complete.","placeholder":"Describe the content you'd like to see - topic, use case, problem ..."},"email":{"label":"Your Email Address","optional":"Optional","helper":"If you'd like us to follow up on your request, please share your email.","errorInvalid":"Please enter a valid email address"},"agree":"Bambu Lab may use the information to improve our course materials in accordance with the \u003c1\u003ePrivacy Notice\u003c/1\u003e.","submit":"Submit Request","submitFailed":"Submission failed, please try again","successTitle":"Request Submitted!","successDesc":"Thank you for submitting your content request! We have added it to our queue for future consideration.","back":"Back to Academy"}},"warranty":{"inquiry":{"banner":{"title":"Extended Warranty Service","desc":"\u003c0\u003e Before purchasing, please carefully read \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ethe Extended Warranty Service Terms\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e. Your payment behavior will be deemed as your acceptance of these service terms.\u003c/2\u003e","button":"Buy now"},"listContent":{"title":"Device Info","subTitle":"View activation date \u0026 services.","sn":"SN","learnMore":"Service Inquiry","expand":"Expand all","noDevice":"There is no bound device information.","loginDesc":"\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eLog in\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e to view bound device information.\u003c/2\u003e","contectDesc":"\u003c0\u003eClick to check how to \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eBind Device\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e or for any \u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003eCustomer Support\u003c/3\u003e\u003c4\u003e.\u003c/4\u003e"},"infoContent":{"title":"Extended warranty information","sn":"SN","printerModel":"Printer model","initialWarrantyStatus":"Initial Warranty","extendedWarrantyStatus":"Extended Warranty","dateOfExpiry":"Warranty Period","eligible":"Eligible for extended warranty purchase","eligibleStatusValue":{"yes":"Yes","no":"No"},"warrantyStatusBasicValue":{"0":"Not started","1":"Under warranty","2":"Expired"},"back":"Back","buyNow":"Buy now","supportText":"\u003c0\u003eNeed any support, please contact \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eCustomer Support\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e","note":"*For printers without an extended warranty, the initial warranty period is for reference only. Please refer to the actual purchase date on your order."}},"extended":{"banner":{"title":"Start Your Bambu Lab Extended Warranty Journey","desc":"Enter Order No. \u0026 Serial Number(SN) to activate extended warranty","button":"Buy now"},"formContent":{"title":"Enter your Order Number and Serial Number (SN)","subTitle":"\u003c0\u003eClick to query how to get \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eorder number\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e and product \u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003eSN code\u003c/3\u003e\u003c4\u003e\u003c/4\u003e","orderNo":"Extended Warranty Order Number","sn":"Serial Number (SN)","formDesc":{"1":"*If you have purchased an extended warranty through the official store but automatic activation failed, you may manually activate it on this page. ","2":"*Please note: Once successfully activated, the extended warranty cannot be refunded. Ensure that you enter the Serial Number (SN) correctly during the activation process."},"submit":"Activate","supportText":"\u003c0\u003eIf you need any support, please contact \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eCustomer Support\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e.\u003c/2\u003e","error":{"2000":"Oops! The information entered seems incorrect. Please check and try again.","2001":"Oops! The serial number you entered seems invalid. Please check try again.","2002":"Failed to retrieve product information. Please try again later.","2003":"This printer has exceeded the maximum extended warranty coverage period. Please select another printer.","2004":"This printer does not meet the required printing time criteria. Please try a different printer.","2005":"Abnormal printing hours have been detected. Please contact customer support for assistance.","2006":"The printer’s region does not match the region of your extended warranty purchase.","2007":"The printer model does not match the model associated with your extended warranty purchase.","2008":"Unable to retrieve printer information. Please contact customer support for assistance.","2009":"No order number found. Please try again later.","3001":"Your extended warranty order has been successfully activated. No further action is needed.","orderNo":{"required":"Order number cannot be empty.","error":"The order number is incorrect. Please verify it and try again."},"sn":{"required":"SN cannot be empty.","error":"The serial number is incorrect. Please verify it and try again."},"default":"System error. Please try again later."}},"infoContent":{"title":"You have successfully activated the extended warranty service for your 3D printer.","boundModel":"Bound Model","sn":"SN","type":"Extended Warranty Type","usageGuides":"Explore more printer usage guides"}}},"euPartnerProgram":{"title":"Hello, Friends from {{partnerName}}.","createForm":{"title":"Create or bind your Bambu Lab store account","forgetPassword":"Forget Password","partnerTermsLabel":"I agree to \u003c1\u003eEPP/SPP's Terms and Conditions\u003c/1\u003e","privacyAndPartnerTermsCheckConfirmDesc":"To proceed, please agree to the \u003c1\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/1\u003e, \u003c3\u003ePrivacy Notices\u003c/3\u003e, \u003c5\u003eEPP/SPP's Terms and Conditions\u003c/5\u003e"}},"trustCenter":{"meta":{"title":"Bambu Lab Trust Center","desc":"Bambu Lab Trust Center provides detailed information about our practices and efforts to build trust with users around the world, covering security, privacy, certification and collaboration.","keywords":"Bambu, Bambulab, Trust Center, Trust, Privacy, Security, Compliance, Certification, Collaboration, Transparency, 3d printer,  IoT, Information Security, Privacy Protection, Data Protection, User Privacy, White Paper, GDPR compliance, IoT security"},"header":{"name":"Trust Center","home":"Home","security":"Security","privacy":"Privacy","certification":"Certification","collaboration":"Collaboration"},"home":{"banner":{"title":"Long-Term Commitment to Privacy and Security","desc":"We recognize that every print reflects your creativity and trust. Bambu Lab remains dedicated to respecting your privacy and protecting your data—because trust matters."},"buildingTrust":{"title":"Build Trust With Us","cards":{"1":{"title":"Security","desc":"Security in our products and services is not optional—it is the foundation of all our innovation and user experience. We treat it as core and pursue it with rigor."},"2":{"title":"Privacy","desc":"Protecting user privacy is more than a promise—it’s a goal we continuously refine and improve, to give you greater confidence."},"3":{"title":"Certification","desc":"With third-party certifications, we provide objective proof that our practices are reliable and widely recognized across the industry."},"4":{"title":"Collaboration","desc":"We maintain an open and collaborative approach, listening to industry experts and constantly improving our offerings."}}},"announcement":{"title":"Latest Announcements"},"contactUs":{"title":"Contact Us","desc":"For Questions \u0026 Inquiries Please Contact Us by E-mail","sendButton":"Send an Email"}},"security":{"banner":{"title":"Security","desc":"Security in our products and services is not optional—it is the foundation of all our innovation and user experience. We treat it as core and pursue it with rigor."},"overview":{"title":"Security Overview","cards":{"1":{"title":"Device Security","cards":{"1":{"title":"Network Security","items":{"1":"Secure Protocols","2":"Secure Cloud Access"}},"2":{"title":"Privacy Protection","items":{"1":"LAN Only Mode","2":"Offline Update"}},"3":{"title":"System Security","items":{"1":"Verified Boot","2":"File System Encryption","3":"Secure Update","4":"Secure Debug"}},"4":{"title":"Hardware Security","items":{"1":"Secure Boot","2":"Secure Engine","3":"Key Management","4":"TEE"}}}},"2":{"title":"Software Security","cards":{"1":{"title":"Open Source","items":{"1":"Bambu Studio"}},"2":{"title":"Privacy Control","items":{"1":"Privacy Settings"}},"3":{"title":"Software Hardering","items":{"1":"Virtual Machine Protection","2":"Code Obfuscation","3":"Anti-Debug"}}}},"3":{"title":"Cloud Security","cards":{"1":{"title":"Privacy Certification","items":{"1":"Truste","2":"ISO/IEC: 27001","3":"ISO/IEC: 27701"}},"2":{"title":"Cloud Defense","items":{"1":"Milti-Layered Protection","2":"User Account Protection","3":"Secure Operation"}}}}}},"device":{"title":"Device Security","cards":{"1":{"title":"Hardware and Chip-Level Security","desc":"Bambu Lab integrates industry-standard secure elements, Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), and hardware-based cryptographic engines. The system enforces secure boot and implements full-chain data encryption, establishing a hardware root of trust to support robust privacy protection."},"2":{"title":"Secure Communication Protocols","desc":"We adopt widely recognized encryption protocols such as HTTPS, MQTTS, and FTPS to safeguard data-in-transit, ensuring resilience against long-term and real-time attack vectors."}}},"cloud":{"title":"Cloud Security","cards":{"1":{"title":"Account Security Mechanisms","desc":"Bambu accounts support federated login via third-party identity providers. Anomalous login behavior triggers two-factor authentication workflows. Users retain autonomy with features like one-click account deactivation and deletion."},"2":{"title":"Cloud Data Protection and Multi-Layer Defense","desc":"Our cloud infrastructure applies encryption to user data by default. Additionally, a multi-layered defense-in-depth approach is implemented to reduce exposure risks and enhance overall data security."}}},"validation":{"title":"Security Validation","cards":{"1":{"title":"Bug Bounty Program","desc":"Bambu Lab launched its Bug Bounty Program (BBP) in 2023 to encourage responsible disclosure of security vulnerabilities.","button":"View Details"},"2":{"title":"Third-Party Certification \u0026 Penetration Test","desc":"Bambu Lab undergoes independent third-party security certifications and conducts regular penetration testing to evaluate and improve system security.","button":"View Details"}}}},"privacy":{"banner":{"title":"Privacy","desc":"Protecting user privacy is more than a promise—it’s a goal we continuously refine and improve, to give you greater confidence."},"principles":{"title":"Privacy Protection Principles","cards":{"1":{"title":"Transparency","desc":"We strive to keep our data practices open and transparent, enabling users to make informed decisions."},"2":{"title":"Collaboration","desc":"We actively listen to user feedback to identify opportunities for improving privacy and security, and continuously enhance our products and services accordingly."},"3":{"title":"User Control","desc":"We aim to provide users with intuitive and accessible tools to manage and control their personal information."},"4":{"title":"Compliance","desc":"Our privacy practices adhere strictly to applicable data protection laws and standards, and are validated through relevant certifications."}},"buttons":{"1":"View Privacy Notice","2":"View Privacy Certification"}},"contactUs":{"sectionTitle":"Contact Our Privacy Team","title":"We welcome user feedback to help us identify areas for improvement in privacy and security.","desc":"If you have any concerns or questions regarding privacy in our products or services, please feel free to contact our privacy team for further assistance.","button":"Send an Email"},"features":{"title":"Product Privacy Features","desc":"Your privacy, your choice. Our products have built-in privacy features that give you the flexibility to customize settings and stay in control of your data.","cards":{"1":{"title":"LAN Only Mode","desc":"Using your device without requiring an internet connection"},"2":{"title":"Offline Upgrade","desc":"Update your device without requiring an internet connection"},"3":{"title":"Log Export Encryption","desc":"You can choose which data to export and protected by AES256"},"4":{"title":"Reset to Factory","desc":"Clean device log and user data"}},"button":"View White-paper for more details"}},"certification":{"banner":{"title":"Certification","desc":"With third-party certifications, we provide objective proof that our practices are reliable and widely recognized across the industry."},"list":{"title":"Certification List"},"materials":{"title":"Security Materials"}},"collaboration":{"banner":{"title":"Collaboration","desc":"We maintain an open and collaborative approach, listening to industry experts and constantly improving our offerings."},"bugBounty":{"title":"The Bambu Lab Bug Bounty Program","desc":"The Bambu Lab Bug Bounty Program is designed to engage independent security researchers in identifying security vulnerabilities across Bambu Lab’s products and infrastructure.\n\nBy offering rewards for verified reports, Bambu Lab fosters responsible disclosure and collaborative improvement—reinforcing our broader strategy of continuous security and privacy enhancement through industry engagement.","moreButton":"More Details"},"thirdPartyIntegration":{"title":"Third Party Integration","desc":"Bambu Lab provides deployable HTTP services and SDKs, enabling third-party developers to build private solutions for automated multi-printer scheduling and management.","cards":{"1":{"title":"For technical details","desc":"Please refer to the official Third-Party Integration documentation.","buttonText":"View Integration Docs"},"2":{"title":"To apply for partnership or request SDK access","desc":"Please submit your application through the official Collaboration page.","buttonText":"Apply for Partnership"}}}},"securityUpdate":{"title":"Bambu Lab Security Updates","desc":"For the security of our users, Bambu Lab does not disclose, discuss, or confirm details about security vulnerabilities until an investigation has been completed and appropriate fixes or releases are available. Security information is published only after remediation is accessible to affected products.","subDesc":"*If you believe you have discovered a security or privacy vulnerability in a Bambu Lab product, please submit your findings through the \u003cbugBountyLink\u003eBambu Lab Bug Bounty Program\u003c/bugBountyLink\u003e, which serves as our primary channel for receiving and tracking vulnerability reports. For general information about our coordinated disclosure principles and reporting expectations, please refer to our \u003cdisclosureLink\u003eVulnerability Disclosure Policy\u003c/disclosureLink\u003e.","sectionTitle":"Security Update","sectionDesc":"This page provides a reference table of security vulnerabilities addressed in official Bambu Lab releases, including firmware, desktop software, and mobile applications. Each release may include fixes for one or more security issues.\nWhen available, vulnerabilities are referenced using CVE identifiers. Bambu Lab may also use internal tracking identifiers for issues that do not have an assigned CVE.","table":{"productVersion":"Product Version","productModel":"Product Model","releaseDate":"Release Date","vulnerabilitiesFixed":"Vulnerabilities Fixed","count":"Count"},"innerTable":{"vulnerabilityId":"Vulnerability ID","type":"Type","component":"Component","description":"High-Level Description"},"pagination":{"pageInfo":"Page {{page}} of {{totalPages}}","prev":"Prev","next":"Next"}}},"bugBounty":{"header":{"name":"Bug Bounty Program","overview":"Overview","scopeAndBounty":"Scope \u0026 Bounty","hallOfFame":"Hall of fame","announcement":"Announcement","myReport":"My Report","button":"Submit"},"overview":{"title":"Bambu Lab \u003ckeywords\u003eBug Bounty\u003c/keywords\u003e Program","desc":"At Bambu Lab, security is a critical part of building connected products and services. Through our Bug Bounty Program, we collaborate with the security community to identify vulnerabilities early and strengthen the safety and reliability of our systems."},"scope":{"title":"Joining the Bug Bounty Program is simple","button":"Submit report","guidelines":"Guidelines","cards":{"1":{"title":"Login: Manage Your Vulnerability Reports","desc":"Log in to our dedicated security platform to easily submit, track, and manage your vulnerability reports in one place."},"2":{"title":"Submission: Report Vulnerabilities","desc":"Submit clear and complete vulnerability reports through the platform."},"3":{"title":"Validation: Expert Review \u0026 Feedback","desc":"Our experts will review and respond within 3-10 business days (may be delayed on holidays)."},"4":{"title":"Reward: Compensation Based on Severity","desc":"Valid vulnerabilities are rewarded based on severity, typically within 1-3 months."},"5":{"title":"Resolution: Fix \u0026 Close the Issue","desc":"Once confirmed, vulnerabilities will be fixed as quickly as possible and fully resolved."}}},"bounty":{"title":"Submit Vulnerability Reports and Earn Bounty Rewards","desc":"We assess vulnerability bounty rewards based on the real-world impact of the complete exploitation chain and offer competitive rewards accordingly. Additional bonuses may be granted for security research that demonstrates significant breakthroughs or materially strengthens our overall security posture.\nTo prevent testing activities from exceeding authorized boundaries and to ensure full legal and compliance alignment, the scope of permitted security testing under this Bug Bounty Program is clearly defined.\nPlease refer to the detailed testing scope and reward rules below."},"hallOfFame":{"title":"Hall of Fame","desc":"The Hall of Fame showcases researchers who have made outstanding contributions to the safety development of Bambu Lab. It consists of two parts: the Contribution List and the Ranking List. The Contribution List records all valid submissions from safety researchers; the Ranking List recognizes the top three researchers who made the most significant contributions in the quarter, in recognition of their important work."},"announcement":{"title":"Announcement","empty":"No announcements yet."},"report":{"title":"My Report","backText":"Go to report list","loginDesc":"You need to log in to view the relevant information.","status":{"reviewing":{"name":"Reviewing","desc":"Reviewing: Your report is currently under review by our security team. We are assessing its impact and will update you as soon as possible."},"rejected":{"name":"Rejected","desc":"Rejected: We have reviewed your report, but it does not meet the criteria for acceptance or reward. Thank you for your contribution."},"confirmed":{"name":"Confirmed","desc":"Confirmed: Congratulations! Your report has been confirmed. We are arranging a bug fix and your reward."},"awarded":{"name":"Awarded","desc":"Awarded: Thank you for your contribution! your reward has been issued. We will update the status once the fix is fully deployed."},"closed":{"name":"Closed","desc":"Closed: The issue has been successfully resolved and verified. Thank you for your valuable report."}},"list":{"newReport":"New Report","noReports":"No Reports","filterStatus":{"open":"Open","closed":"Closed","draft":"Draft"}},"create":{"title":"Enter Report Title","desc":"Prerequisites for reproduction:\n1.\n2.\n3.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1.\n2.\n3.","information":"Add more information....","files":"Click or drop files here to attch · Maximum size: 500MB","privacy":"I have read and agree to the Bambu Lab Bug Bounty Program and these \u003ctermsLink\u003eTerms and Conditions\u003c/termsLink\u003e.","allowRanking":"Show my nickname on the Hall of Fame.","submit":"Submit","delete":"Delete","addComment":"Add Comment","success":"Submission successful","error":"Submission failed, please try again.","tooMoreDrafts":"The draft is full. If you need it to be automatically saved as a draft, please clean it up first","validate":{"titleRequired":"Please enter the report title","titleMax":"The report title cannot exceed {{max}} characters","descRequired":"Please enter the report description","descMax":"The report description cannot exceed {{max}} characters","informationRequired":"Please enter the information","informationMax":"The information cannot exceed {{max}} characters","agreeRequired":"Please agree to the terms of use and privacy notice"}},"detail":{"bounty":"Bounty: ${{bounty}}","bountyCN":"Bounty: ¥{{bounty}}","cve":"CVE:","number":"Number:","reportedOn":"Reported On: {{reportedOn}}","customerServiceName":"Bambu Lab Security Team"}}}},"debug":{"button":"Button","welcomeUser":"Hello 1 \u003cstrong\u003e{{name}}\u003c/strong\u003e. \u003c3\u003eSEE MY PROFILE\u003c/3\u003e"},"layout":{"footer":{"menu":{"cookie_policy":"Cookie Policy","cookie_preference":"Cookie Settings"},"copyright":"Copyright © {{year}} Bambu Lab All Rights Reserved.","copyrightMwStoreFull":"© {{year}} {{name}}. All Rights Reserved.","copyrightMwStore":"© {{year}} MakerMarket. All Rights Reserved."}},"image":{"index":{"video":"https://portal.bblmw.com/home/video.mp4","videoBg":"https://portal.bblmw